  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/ca81259519cadfb2d5350673c220e419e60378e9770ad26512fc8e826a8d93f1.png] **__Shortcut Trick__ **\n\n(x5 - 12x4 + 12x3 - 12x2 + 12x - 1)\n\n⇒ (x5 - 11x4 - x4 + 11x3 + x3 - 11x2 - x2 + 11x + x - 1)\n\n⇒ x4(x - 11) - x3(x - 11) + x2(x - 11) - x(x - 11) + (x - 1)\n\n⇒ (x - 11) [x4 - x3 + x2 - x] + (x - 1)\n\nput x = 11\n\n⇒ (11 - 11) [x4 - x3 + x2 - x] + (11 - 1)\n\n⇒ 0 × [x4 - x3 + x2 - x] + (11 - 1)\n\n⇒ (11 - 1) = 10\n\n**Hence, the correct answer is 10.**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c76c13ba2d2ab46b47f8a931ae621dac081a0cb266b142dc23f58659fac4a466.png] **__Alternate Method__**\n\n**Given:**\n\nIf x = 11, then the value of (x⁵ - 12x⁴ + 12x³ - 12x² + 12x - 1) is:\n\n**Formula used:**\n\nSubstitute x = 11 in the polynomial expression\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(11⁵ - 12×11⁴ + 12×11³ - 12×11² + 12×11 - 1)\n\n⇒ 161051 - 12×14641 + 12×1331 - 12×121 + 12×11 - 1\n\n⇒ 161051 - 175692 + 15972 - 1452 + 132 - 1\n\n⇒ 161051 - 175692 + 15972 - 1452 + 132 - 1\n\n⇒ -14641 + 15972 - 1452 + 132 - 1\n\n⇒ 1331 - 1452 + 132 - 1\n\n⇒ -121 + 132 - 1\n\n⇒ 11 - 1\n\n⇒ 10\n\n**∴ The correct answer is option (4).**",
